	(text "Todo:\n1. Change GPIO2 to 3/4 for sensor analog reading\n2. Add external pull down 47k for analog\n3. Change GPIO1 to 3/4 or 5-9 for 12V MOSFET switch\n4. Change pull down to 10k for 12V MOSFET switch\n5. (Not needed)Add \"a small N-channel MOSFET (like a 2N7002) \n	at the bottom of your voltage divider\" to control power estimate\n6. Change from 3.3V to GPIO for sensor powering\n7. Add 32.768 kHz Crystal for low power and accurate time when sleep\n8. change n mosfet to SI2310/AO3422, or add zener diode \n	from gate to source"
